  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIG Component 3: Policy Technical Assistance and Learning Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will address policy bottlenecks preventing PE/VC funds being established or other specific challenges for SMEs accessing finance. This could include regional consensus initiatives and exchange opportunities to convene both public and private sector in the region on SME development.</narrative>
  </description>
